<title>USA: Comsat patent infringement suit settled.</title>
<headline>Comsat patent infringement suit settled.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comsat Corp, General Instrument Corp and Scientific-Atlanta Inc Tuesday said they had settled a patent infringement action filed by Comsat against Chronicle Publishing Co.</p>
<p>Terms of the settlement are confidential but include a dismissal of all claims, they said.</p>
